# ── AI Intake Kiosk — Environment Variables ──────────────────────────────────
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your keys:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── GROQ API — AI Clinical Summary Generation (RECOMMENDED for live demo) ─────
# Free tier. Sign up at: https://console.groq.com/
# After signup, go to API Keys → Create API Key. Paste it below.
# Without this key, the app falls back to a structured template summary.
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Google Cloud Speech-to-Text (optional, for production Marathi ASR) ────────
# Provides better accuracy for Marathi and other Indian languages than Web Speech API.
# Free tier: 60 minutes/month.
# Docs: https://cloud.google.com/speech-to-text
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
# GOOGLE_STT_LANGUAGE_CODE=mr-IN

# ── Google Cloud Text-to-Speech (optional, for server-side Marathi TTS) ───────
# Better Marathi voice quality than browser speechSynthesis.
# Free tier: 1 million characters/month.
# Docs: https://cloud.google.com/text-to-speech
# GOOGLE_TTS_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
# GOOGLE_TTS_LANGUAGE_CODE=mr-IN
# GOOGLE_TTS_VOICE_NAME=mr-IN-Standard-A

# ── OpenAI Whisper (optional, for production-grade ASR) ───────────────────────
# Alternative to Google STT. Supports Hindi/Marathi via language code 'mr'.
# Pricing: ~$0.006 per minute.
# Docs: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/speech-to-text
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
# WHISPER_LANGUAGE=mr

# ── ABDM / ABHA OTP Integration (optional, for real ABHA verification) ────────
# Currently the OTP check is mocked (any 6-digit code passes).
# To enable real ABHA OTP verification, provide your ABDM sandbox/production credentials.
# Docs: https://sandbox.abdm.gov.in/docs
# ABDM_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
# ABDM_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret
# ABDM_BASE_URL=https://dev.abdm.gov.in/gateway
